Nola Beans","address":"762 Harrison Ave","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70124","stars":3.5,"review_count":71,"categories":["Food","Coffee & Tea","Restaurants"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1099,"mm_rank":926,"target_category_support_fraction":1.0,"selected_image_count":4,"label_diversity":4,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Coffee & Tea","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","review_id":"X-w32H0Ep-uvjvP1jDpH_A","date":"2014-08-26T16:14:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9379621148109436,"text_excerpt":"I'm a fan of NOLA Beans mostly for it's vibe and location. It's in a great area of Lakeview, and the place is very open and airy. The coffee is okay. I tend to get the flavored iced coffees. There's a wide variety of flavors to choose from! Typically, I come early AM during the weekdays. They're not too crowded, and I pick up a coffee and breakfast sandwich. Quick and reasonably priced. They also serve lunch which I've only had once. They're closed for dinner. Free wi-fi, just ask for the password. You order at the counter and they bring it to your table. A couple of tables are outside if you want to sit out on the sidewalk. If you're looking for somewhere not-Starbucks with some food and..."},{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","review_id":"ExQH59Cu26UNP5S1tc3PRQ","date":"2020-11-24T03:44:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9367861747741699,"text_excerpt":"This coffee shop has a nice location close to City Park. It was busy when I went on a Sunday morning and for good reason. I especially liked my breakfast sandwich (egg, cheese, and sausage on an english muffin). It was warm and delicious. The drinks and food are priced perfectly. Even with the rush, the staff was hardworking and getting orders out as soon as they could. There were tables to sit inside and outside. They had many pieces of local art for sale and viewing around the store. I believe they also had goods from other local folks which is always good to see. Definitely try this place out!"},{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","review_id":"KRj1JgJYB4Xoy6Qt0kKqwA","date":"2017-06-18T20:01:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9352493286132812,"text_excerpt":"So, I'll admit it: I end up here for breakfast when another place is too crowded. But today we realized this place is too good to just be a back up. Staff is friendly, coffee is great, and the breakfast sandwiches are great. Others seem to be figuring this out also--each time it's a little more crowded than the previous time. Very nice breakfast place and coffee shop. Real NOLA neighborhood feel. Oh...and I see they serve lunch, too. I'm looking forward to trying that soon."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","photo_id":"ieiPMgXoyNQeVjQdq3gLJQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ieiPMgXoyNQeVjQdq3gLJQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9154987335205078},{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","photo_id":"N9o_pkZOk-EUFfF5jqiXpQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/N9o_pkZOk-EUFfF5jqiXpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8807085752487183},{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","photo_id":"6ZrRbB9FfidQBdBLCk4XJA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/6ZrRbB9FfidQBdBLCk4XJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8730832934379578},{"business_id":"gGf7dpWXL13f57CwTIvEkA","photo_id":"8RF1YD_ImxptT_Wht4iFGw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8RF1YD_ImxptT_Wht4iFGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8462662696838379}]},"notebook_case":null}
